{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o042d","title":"诏删定大辟减少死罪","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o042d-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"诏删定大辟减少死罪","evidence":["mingdi-e-o042d-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"十二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"十二月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o042d-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o042d-q","source_order":[3,272,"O042d"],"order":870}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o042d-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-1ca3e77057e9c038bdd4","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，乙丑〖17〗，月犯镇星及轩辕。戊寅〖18〗，月犯太白。十一月，京都地震，从东南来，隐隐有声，摇动屋瓦。十二月，诏有司删定大辟〖19〗，减死罪。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":271,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offse